{"id":"567cf4d8b6193602","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Scale Good Point","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Good Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Good Point","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-good-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Good Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c8f804f98505ae8\" href=\"?note=6c8f804f98505ae8\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md\">../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\vec f,\\delta,U,S\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta,U,S\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S,\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S,\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S,\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S,\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleGoodPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleGoodPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}scale\\text{-}good\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleGoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),\\vec f)\n\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\delta&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\n\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)&gt;|A|\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\delta\\;\\exists S\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(U,\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,U,J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\n\\forall a\\in A\\setminus(S(\\alpha)\\cup S(\\beta))\\;\n\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}scale\\text{-}good\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleGoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),\\vec f)\n\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\delta&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\n\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)&gt;|A|\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\delta\\;\\exists S\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(U,\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,U,J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\n\\forall a\\in A\\setminus(S(\\alpha)\\cup S(\\beta))\\;\n\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An exact upper bound alone does not define a good point. The defining\nwitness is an unbounded subsystem that is pointwise increasing off\ncoordinate-wise <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>-small exceptional sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locatio